                <pb facs="0585" n="473" sameAs="frus:frus1910/pg473"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Sherrill to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Buenos
                                Aires</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1910-06-17"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">June 17,
                    1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Your June 15. Argentine minister for foreign affairs approves your action and is
                    instructing his representatives accordingly.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sherrill.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
